│ implantation (l‐HA 22.1%, h‐HA 24.2%), or abortion (l‐HA 24.0%, h‐HA 20.8%) rates between the two groups. In the     │
│ case of frozen‐thawed embryo transfer cycles, no significant differences were noted in the pregnancy (l‐HA 20.9%,    │
│ h‐HA 22.9%), implantation (l‐HA 13.4%, h‐HA 15.8%), or abortion (l‐HA 17.2%, h‐HA 21.5%) rates. In the case of       │
