│ this study. In the Hyaluronan (HA) group (n = 290), embryos were transferred from hyaluronan-enriched transfer       │
│ medium. In Control group (n = 291), a conventional embryo transfer medium was used. RESULTS There was no significant │
│ difference in clinical pregnancy rate (42.4 vs. 39.2%), implantation rate (23.3 vs. 23.2%), and delivery rate (31.0  │
