│ (111 vs. 110). However, birth weight was significantly higher in the HA group than in the Control group (3,018 ± 598 │
│ g vs. 2,724 ± 698 g, P = 0.001). Clinical pregnancy, implantation and delivery rates did not differ significantly    │
